&lt;p&gt;部署 Operator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;kubectl apply -f &lt;a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-xtradb-cluster-operator/v1.12.0/deploy/bundle.yaml"&gt;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-xtradb-cluster-operator/v1.12.0/deploy/bundle.yaml&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;部署 PXC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;kubectl apply -f &lt;a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-xtradb-cluster-operator/v1.12.0/deploy/cr.yaml"&gt;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-xtradb-cluster-operator/v1.12.0/deploy/cr.yaml&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>